<div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">You were signed out everywhere</h1>
  <p>
    A "remember me" cookie for <strong><%= user.email %></strong> was used
    after it had already been replaced. That happens when the cookie was
    copied: someone else may have been signed in to your account.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every session was ended. Sign in again &mdash; and if you did not expect
    this message, <a href="<%= reset_url %>">change your password</a>.
  </p>
</div>
